        <div class="wl-intro"><div class="wl-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="wl-pulse" aria-hidden="true"></span>Welcome · <span class="zh-font">歡迎光臨</span></div><h1 class="wl-hello" id="wl-h0" tabindex="-1" lang="zh-Hant" data-wsplit>歡迎光臨</h1><p class="wl-sub" data-wsplit>Welcome to the Mandarin Taiwan actually speaks.</p><p class="wl-lede">Traditional characters, Pinyin <em>and</em> Zhuyin, and the phrases you’ll hear at the night market, on the MRT and in the office. Set up your learner ID, then you’re in.</p><div class="wl-facts"><div><b class="num">${stages}</b><span>stages</span></div><div><b class="num">${qs.toLocaleString()}</b><span>questions</span></div><div><b class="num">${clips.toLocaleString()}</b><span>audio clips</span></div></div></div><div class="wl-sign" aria-hidden="true"><div class="wl-board"><span>閒</span><span class="flick">台</span><span>文</span></div><div class="wl-plate" lang="zh-Hant">營業中<small>OPEN</small></div></div></div>
